  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foster Gender Sensitive, Resilient, and Socially Cohesive Society in Response to Climate Shocks and Risks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CO intends to use the TRAC 2 fund in an integrated and portfolio approach to &#x201c;Foster Gender Sensitive, Resilient, and Socially Cohesive Society in Response to Climate Shocks and Risks&#x201d;. The TRAC 2 fund shall seek to generate new data and evidence on Gender, climate, and security related risks nexus. The data will inform the CO pipeline development, policy actions to enhance climate security and resilience, and social cohesion. The fund shall also be used to support women and youth (female) i</narrative>
  </description>
